ble:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:scale-[0.96] [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:opacity-90 max-sm:hit-target h-9 shrink-0 rounded-full px-3 text-xs capitalize" type="button">memories</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium tracking-normal transition-[transform,background-color,box-shadow,opacity,border-color] duration-200 ease-smooth focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:scale-[0.96] [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-default text-default-foreground hover:bg-default/78 max-sm:hit-target h-9 shrink-0 rounded-full px-3 text-xs capitalize" type="button">skills</button></div></div><div class="relative min-h-0 flex-1"><div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(12px)"><div class="flex h-full flex-col px-3 pb-4 md:px-4"><div class="mb-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg bg-surface-secondary px-3 py-2 font-mono text-[10px] leading-relaxed text-muted scrollbar-thin"><span class="whitespace-nowrap"><span class="text-foreground/75">mcp</span> <span class="text-foreground">memory.retrieve</span><span class="text-muted"> → …</span></span></div><svg viewBox="0 0 640 360" class="min-h-0 w-full flex-1 select-none" aria-label="Interactive memory graph preview" fill="none"><path d="M168 92 L320 176" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" class="text-foreground/80" opacity="0.28"></path><path d="M320 176 L508 108" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="3 5" class="text-foreground/80 landing-graph-dash" opacity="0.75"></path><path d="M112 248 L320 176" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" class="text-foreground/80" opacity="0.28"></path><path d="M536 248 L320 176" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" class="text-foreground/80" opacity="0.28"></path><path d="M168 92 L112 248" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" class="text-foreground/80" opacity="0.28"></path><path d="M508 108 L536 248" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" class="text-foreground/80" opacity="0.28"></path><path d="M248 64 L168 92" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" class="text-foreground/80" opacity="0.28"></path><path d="M248 64 L320 176" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" class="text-foreground/80" opacity="0.28"></path><circle r="3.5" fill="currentColor" class="text-foreground"><animateMotion dur="3.2s" repeatCount="indefinite" keyPoints="0;1" keyTimes="0;1" calcMode="linear"><mpath href="#landing-recall-path"></mpath></animateMotion></circle><path id="landing-recall-path" d="M320 176 L508 108" stroke="none" fill="none"></path><g class="cursor-pointer" opacity="1" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="profile memory node"><circle cx="168" cy="92" r="22" fill="transparent"></circle><circle cx="168" cy="92" r="8" fill="#a8a8a8" class="transition-[opacity]"></circle><text x="168" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="pointer-events-none text-[10px] font-medium fill-muted" style="font-family:Instrument Sans, system-ui, sans-serif">profile</text></g><g class="cursor-pointer" opacity="1" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="episodic memory node"><circle cx="320" cy="176" r="26" fill="transparent"></circle><circle cx="320" cy="176" r="12" fill="#a8a8a8" class="transition-[opacity] landing-preview-pulse"></circle><text x="320" y="204" text-anchor="middle" class="pointer-events-none text-[10px] font-medium fill-muted" style="font-family:Instrument Sans, system-ui, sans-serif">episodic</text></g><g class="cursor-pointer" opacity="1" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="knowledge memory node"><circle cx="508" cy="108" r="23" fill="transparent"></circle><circle cx="508" cy="108" r="9" fill="#a8a8a8" class="transition-[opacity]"></circle><text x="508" y="90" text-anchor="middle" class="pointer-events-none text-[10px] font-medium fill-muted" style="font-family:Instrument Sans, system-ui, sans-serif">knowledge</text></g><g class="cursor-pointer" opacity="1" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="tool output memory node"><circle cx="112" cy="248" r="21" fill="transparent"></circle><circle cx="112" cy="248" r="7" fill="#a8a8a8" class="transition-[opacity]"></circle><text x="112" y="270" text-anchor="middle" class="pointer-events-none text-[10px] font-medium fill-muted" style="font-family:Instrument Sans, system-ui, sans-serif">tool output</text></g><g class="cursor-pointer" opacity="1" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="entity memory node"><circle cx="536" cy="248" r="21" fill="transparent"></circle><circle cx="536" cy="248" r="7" fill="#d4d4d4" class="transition-[opacity]"></circle><text x="536" y="270" text-anchor="middle" class="pointer-events-none text-[10px] font-medium fill-muted" style="font-family:Instrument Sans, system-ui, sans-serif">entity</text></g><g class="cursor-pointer" opacity="1" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="skill memory node"><circle cx="248" cy="64" r="21" fill="transparent"></circle><circle cx="248" cy="64" r="7" fill="#a8a8a8" class="transition-[opacity]"></circle><text x="248" y="46" text-anchor="middle" class="pointer-events-none text-[10px] font-medium fill-muted" style="font-family:Instrument Sans, system-ui, sans-serif">skill</text></g></svg><p class="mt-1 min-h-[2.75rem] text-pretty text-[11px] leading-relaxed transition-[color] duration-200 sm:text-xs text-muted">Select a node to see what recall surfaces — connected context, not a keyword dump.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="recall" class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 scroll-mt-24 py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-32"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.1fr)] lg:items-start lg:gap-16"><div><div class="" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(14px)"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-muted sm:text-xs sm:tracking-[0.28em]">Recall</p><h2 class="text-balance font-semibold text-3xl leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.03em] text-foreground sm:text-5xl">Ask like an agent would</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-pretty text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:mt-5 sm:text-base">Hybrid search mixes fulltext, vectors, chunks, entities, and one hop of graph expansion. Every hit ships a Context Trace so you can see why it matched.</p></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(14px)"><div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium tracking-normal transition-[transform,background-color,box-shadow,opacity,border-color] duration-200 ease-smooth focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:scale-[0.96] [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:opacity-90 h-8 text-xs max-sm:hit-target rounded-full px-3.5" type="button">Editor preference</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium tracking-normal transition-[transform,background-color,box-shadow,opacity,border-color] duration-200 ease-smooth focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:scale-[0.96] [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-default text-default-foreground hover:bg-default/78 h-8 text-xs max-sm:hit-target rounded-full px-3.5" type="button">Convex lag</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium tracking-normal transition-[transform,background-color,box-shadow,opacity,border-color] duration-200 ease-smooth focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:scale-[0.96] [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-default text-default-foreground hover:bg-default/78 h-8 text-xs max-sm:hit-target rounded-full px-3.5" type="button">Final year project</button></div></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(14px)"><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-separator bg-surface p-2"><div class="rounded-2xl bg-surface-secondary px-3.5 py-3 font-mono text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-muted sm:text-xs"><span class="text-foreground/70">mcp</span> <span class="text-foreground">memory.retrieve</span><span class="text-muted">(&quot;What editor does the user prefer?&quot;)</span></div><div class="min-h-[18rem] px-2 py-3 sm:px-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><div style="opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(12px)"><div class="rounded-xl bg-background/60"><button class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium tracking-normal transition-[transform,background-color,box-shadow,opacity,border-color] duration-200 ease-smooth focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:scale-[0.96] [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-surface-tertiary hover:text-foreground h-auto w-full justify-start gap-3 rounded-xl px-3 py-2.5 text-left" type="button" aria-expanded="true"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-sm font-medium text-foreground">Editor and reply preferences</span><span class="shrink-0 text-xs tabular-nums text-muted underline decoration-dotted decoration-muted/40 underline-offset-2">100%</span></button><div class="px-3 pb-3" style="opacity:1;filter:blur(0px);transform:none"><p class="mb-3 text-pretty text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted">Prefers dark mode, vim keybindings, and concise agent replies. Short answers over padded summaries.</p><div class="mb-2 flex items-baseline justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-muted">Retrieval score</span><span class="text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-foreground">0.94</span></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-[88px] shrink-0 text-[10px] text-muted">Content match</span><div class="h-1.5 flex-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-surface-secondary"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-foreground/70" style="width:91%"></div></div><span class="w-9 shrink-0 text-right text-[10px] tabular-nums text-muted">0.91</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-[88px] shrink-0 text-[10px] text-muted">Semantic match</span><div class="h-1.5 flex-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-surface-secondary"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-foreground/70" style="width:88%"></div></div><span class="w-9 shrink-0 text-right text-[10px] tabular-nums text-muted">0.88</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-[88px] shrink-0 text-[10px] text-muted">Recency</span><div class="h-1.5 flex-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-surface-secondary"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-foreground/70" style="width:62%"></div></div><span class="w-9 shrink-0 text-right text-[10px] tabular-nums text-muted">0.62</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-[88px] shrink-0 text-[10px] text-muted">Confidence</span><div class="h-1.5 flex-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-surface-secondary"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-foreground/70" style="width:90%"></div></div><span class="w-9 shrink-0 text-right text-[10px] tabular-nums text-muted">0.90</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-[88px] shrink-0 text-[10px] text-muted">Chunk match</span><div class="h-1.5 flex-1 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-surface-secondary"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-foreground/70" style="width:40%"></div></div><span class="w-9 shrink-0 text-right text-[10px] tabular-nums text-muted">0.40</span></div></div><p class="mt-3 text-[11px] italic leading-snug text-muted">Matched because: fulltext hit on editor preferences, strong semantic match, recent profile memory</p></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(12px)"><div class="rounded-xl bg-background/60"><button class="inline-flex items-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium tracking-normal transition-[transform,background-color,box-shadow,opacity,border-color] duration-200 ease-smooth focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:scale-[0.96] [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-surface-tertiary hover:text-foreground h-auto w-full justify-start gap-3 rounded-xl px-3 py-2.5 text-left" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-sm font-medium text-foreground">memory.retrieve skill</span><span class="shrink-0 text-xs tabular-nums text-muted underline decoration-dotted decoration-muted/40 underline-offset-2">44%</span></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="how" class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 scroll-mt-24 py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-32"><div><div class="" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(14px)"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-muted sm:text-xs sm:tracking-[0.28em]">How it works</p><h2 class="text-balance font-semibold text-3xl leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.03em] text-foreground sm:text-5xl">Store, connect, then recall</h2></div></div><div class="mt-10" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(14px)"><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-separator"><div class="grid gap-px bg-separator md:grid-cols-3"><div class="bg-background p-6 sm:p-7"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.28em] text-muted">01</p><p class="mt-3 text-base font-medium text-foreground">Store</p><p class="mt-1.5 max-w-xs text-pretty text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Capture context from chat, tools, and HTTP — tagged by profile, so workspaces stay separate.</p></div><div class="bg-background p-6 sm:p-7"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.28em] text-muted">02</p><p class="mt-3 text-base font-medium text-foreground">Connect</p><p class="mt-1.5 max-w-xs text-pretty text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Memories link in a graph. Relationships survive between sessions instead of sitting in a flat list.</p></div><div class="bg-background p-6 sm:p-7"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.28em] text-muted">03</p><p class="mt-3 text-base font-medium text-foreground">Recall</p><p class="mt-1.5 max-w-xs text-pretty text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Agents pull the right slice via MCP, skills, or the API — and get a Context Trace with the answer.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3"><div class="" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(14px)"><div class="group relative flex gap-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-separator bg-surface px-3.5 py-3.5 transition-[transform,background-color] duration-200 ease-out hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-surface-secondary sm:gap-4 sm:px-5 sm:py-4"><div class="absolute inset-y-3 left-0 w-1 rounded-full bg-foreground/0 transition-[background-color] duration-200 group-hover:bg-foreground/20" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-foreground text-background transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.04]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-topology-star-3 "><path d="M10 19a2 2 0 1 0 -4 0a2 2 0 0 0 4 0"></path><path d="M18 5a2 2 0 1 0 -4 0a2 2 0 0 0 4 0"></path><path d="M10 5a2 2 0 1 0 -4 0a2 2 0 0 0 4 0"></path><path d="M6 12a2 2 0 1 0 -4 0a2 2 0 0 0 4 0"></path><path d="M18 19a2 2 0 1 0 -4 0a2 2 0 0 0 4 0"></path><path d="M14 12a2 2 0 1 0 -4 0a2 2 0 0 0 4 0"></path><path d="M22 12a2 2 0 1 0 -4 0a2 2 0 0 0 4 0"></path><path d="M6 12h4"></path><path d="M14 12h4"></path><path d="M15 7l-2 3"></path><path d="M9 7l2 3"></path><path d="M11 14l-2 3"></path><path d="M13 14l2 3"></path></svg></div><div class="min-w-0 pt-0.5"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground">Graph-native memory</p><p class="mt-1 text-pretty text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted sm:text-[0.8125rem]">See context as a network — not a flat list of notes.</p></div></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(14px)"><div class="group relative flex gap-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-separator bg-surface px-3.5 py-3.5 transition-[transform,background-color] duration-200 ease-out hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-surface-secondary sm:gap-4 sm:px-5 sm:py-4"><div class="absolute inset-y-3 left-0 w-1 rounded-full bg-foreground/0 transition-[background-color] duration-200 group-hover:bg-foreground/20" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-foreground text-background transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.04]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-brain "><path d="M15.5 13a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 -3.5 3.5v1a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 7 0v-1.8"></path><path d="M8.5 13a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 3.5 3.5v1a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 -7 0v-1.8"></path><path d="M17.5 16a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 -7h-.5"></path><path d="M19 9.3v-2.8a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 -7 0"></path><path d="M6.5 16a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 -7h.5"></path><path d="M5 9.3v-2.8a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 7 0v10"></path></svg></div><div class="min-w-0 pt-0.5"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground">Built for recall</p><p class="mt-1 text-pretty text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted sm:text-[0.8125rem]">Episodic, knowledge, and profile memories that persist.</p></div></div></div><div class="" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(14px)"><div class="group relative flex gap-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-separator bg-surface px-3.5 py-3.5 transition-[transform,background-color] duration-200 ease-out hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-surface-secondary sm:gap-4 sm:px-5 sm:py-4"><div class="absolute inset-y-3 left-0 w-1 rounded-full bg-foreground/0 transition-[background-color] duration-200 group-hover:bg-foreground/20" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-foreground text-background transition-transform duration-200 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.04]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-bolt "><path d="M13 3l0 7l6 0l-8 11l0 -7l-6 0l8 -11"></path></svg></div><div class="min-w-0 pt-0.5"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-foreground">Agent-ready</p><p class="mt-1 text-pretty text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted sm:text-[0.8125rem]">MCP, HTTP API, and skills your agents can call.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="surfaces" class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 scroll-mt-24 py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-32"><div><div class="" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(14px)"><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="mb-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-muted sm:text-xs sm:tracking-[0.28em]">Surfaces</p><h2 class="text-balance font-semibold text-3xl leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.03em] text-foreground sm:text-5xl">MCP, HTTP, and an SDK on the same graph</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-pretty text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:mt-5 sm:text-base">The dashboard is how you inspect it. Agents talk to it through the same store.</p></div></div><div class="mt-10" style="opacity:0;filter:blur(4px);transform:translateY(14px)"><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-separator"><div class="grid gap-px bg-separator lg:grid-cols-3"><article class="flex h-full flex-col bg-background"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col px-5 pb-4 pt-5 sm:px-6"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">MCP</p><h3 class="mt-2 text-base font-medium text-foreground">Call it from an agent</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-pretty text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">memory.retrieve and memory.save over Clerk OAuth. Team scope lives at /mcp/team.</p></div><pre class="overflow-x-auto border-t border-separator bg-surface px-5 py-4 font-mono text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-muted scrollbar-thin sm:px-6">mcp memory.retrieve
  &quot;What editor does the user prefer?&quot;

→ 2 matches
  profile  0.94  vim, concise replies
  skill    0.41  via memory.retrieve</pre></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col bg-background"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col px-5 pb-4 pt-5 sm:px-6"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">HTTP</p><h3 class="mt-2 text-base font-medium text-foreground">Same graph over REST</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-pretty text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Bearer vmem_sk_… against /api/v1/memories. Create, search, and patch without the dashboard.</p></div><pre class="overflow-x-auto border-t border-separator bg-surface px-5 py-4 font-mono text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-muted scrollbar-thin sm:px-6">POST /api/v1/memories/search
Authorization: Bearer vmem_sk_…
{ &quot;query&quot;: &quot;preferred language&quot; }</pre></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col bg-background"><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col px-5 pb-4 pt-5 sm:px-6"><p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">SDK</p><h3 class="mt-2 text-base font-medium text-foreground">A few lines in Node</h3><p class="mt-1.5 text-pretty text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">@vmem/sdk saves, updates, and searches. Conflicting updates become proposals instead of silent overwrites.</p></div><pre class="overflow-x-auto border-t border-separator bg-surface px-5 py-4 font-mono text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-muted scrollbar-thin sm:px-6">import { VMemory } from &quot;@vmem/sdk&quot;;

const vmem = new VMemory();
await vmem.save(&quot;User prefers TypeScript&quot;);
const { memories } = await vmem.search(
  &quot;preferred language&quot;,
);</pre></article></div></div></div></div></section><div class="landing-atmosphere landing-grain relative overflow-hidden border-t border-separator"><section class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 relative z-10 py-20 sm:py-28"><div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center"><h2 class="max-w-2xl text-balance font-semibold text-3xl leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.03em] text-foreground sm:text-5xl">Put memory under the agents you already use</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-pretty text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:text-base">Create an account, open a profile, add a memory. Check it shows up on the graph.</p><div class="mt-9"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-lg text-sm font-medium tracking-normal transition-[transform,background-color,box-shadow,opacity,border-color] duration-200 ease-smooth focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-focus-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:scale-[0.96] [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:opacity-90 h-11 px-6 sm:min-w-40">Get started<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="tabler-icon tabler-icon-arrow-right " aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12l14 0"></path><path d="M13 18l6 -6"></path><path d="M13 6l6 6"></path></svg></button></div></div></section></div></main><footer class="border-t border-separator"><div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-10 flex flex-col gap-6 pb-[max(2.5rem,env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] pt-10 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><div><span class="inline-flex flex-row items-center gap-2"><svg width="22" height="22" 